{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8f123741-e5a2-85bc-affb-43d992a64373",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:56:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling because the plow, it knocked over the mailbox again. Again! This is not the first time this winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:54:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Where is the mailbox, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 369 Callender Avenue, in the North End. I manage the house for the owner, so I am the one who comes and fixes everything. The post is lying in the snowbank, the box is flat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:54:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 369 Callender. And the plow hit it this morning, or was it earlier in the week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I found it this morning. The plow came in the night, I think. Nobody leaves a note, nothing. And the mail, it cannot be delivered when there is no box. So I am asking, when will it be cleared? The snow is piled on top of it, you understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So there are two pieces. I'll put in a report about the damaged mailbox, and the crew can look at the pile. Can I get a name and a number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zelia Semedo. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Zelia. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Now, the pile, when? Today? Tomorrow? The children on this street, they walk in the road because the sidewalk is blocked. My tenant's kid has gym class today and he always forgets his sneakers, so now he is running back and forth, and I am out here with the shovel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no good. I can't promise you a time on the pile, but I'm marking it as a priority because of the sidewalk. Realistically you're looking at later today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Hm. And what does it mean, priority? It means somebody really comes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It means it goes to the top of the list for the crew supervisor. Somebody will look at it, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope so. I am tired of calling about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:56:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Someone will call you if there's a question. Take care, Zelia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:56:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
